        "reachability": {
          "classification": "external-reachable",
          "entry_points": [
            "Transaction"
          ],
          "attacker_controlled": true,
          "bug_bounty_scope": "conditional"
        },
        "test_procedure": "1. Review patricialize for the branch value position assertion.\n2. Attempt to create a state where len(key) == level for Account/Receipt/Uint type.\n3. Verify AssertionError is raised (or correct handling occurs).\n4. In secured tries, verify this case cannot occur due to key length uniformity.\n5. In unsecured tries, verify protection is adequate.",
